#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/certified-hardware.rst:10
#: 2ff657b675cb4420b6f28c06ad908e2b
msgid ""
"**Warning:** The Qubes OS Project certifies only that a particular hardware "
"*configuration* is *supported* by Qubes OS and is available to purchase with "
"Qubes OS preinstalled. We take no responsibility for any vendor’s "
"manufacturing, shipping, payment, or other practices; nor can we control "
"whether physical hardware is modified (whether maliciously or otherwise) *en "
